# AI Coding System

Connect **one** project-brain MCP: `ai-coding-system`. Prefer the **user-global** rule `~/.cursor/rules/ai-coding-system-mcp.mdc` (applies in every project).

## Session start

1. `register_project` or `get_project_context` with absolute workspace path.
2. Follow stored constraints / handoff; do not re-ask for known architecture.

## Per task

1. `prepare_context` (opt in memory/graph only if needed).
2. `discipline_rules` while implementing; `security_refs` when security-relevant.
3. Targeted `quality_check` / `security_scan` / `review_diff` — not every edit.

## Task complete

`finalize_task` with handoff fields and optional checks only when warranted.

## Token discipline

Do not load all providers every turn. Prefer `get_handoff` for fast editor switches.
